Studio (behind its flag):
- «Кто вы?» moves from the Workbench page into the first-run tour, right
  after hello (hero_picker.ts: the persona agent's v4 heroes, frames and
  effects as static files and hero_fx.ts; Alegreya SC under the SIL OFL,
  persona/OFL.txt). The pick is kept (meridian.studio.persona); when the tour
  ends, designer and manager get Studio pinned and opened, developer the
  Workbench, everyday nothing (SidebarHandler::SetStudioPersona). People who
  never see the tour: a one-time card and a «Who you are» row in Settings ›
  Profiles, which open the heroes alone.
- A long session opens at its end: studioTranscript "tail" reads the last
  2 MB, "before" the page before a point (never the whole file).
- The result may be a page file the task wrote (.html, .htm, .pdf on this
  computer), opened next to Studio like a site, and reloaded when it changes.

